Properties
/ Stage 3 — fill in the properties of the actions the decider chose.
/
/ This one IS an LLM call, not a decider question: a property value is written, not chosen from a
/ closed set. The decider answers "which of these", and there is no list of every string a Path
/ could be.
/
/ One request for the whole goal, because the steps refer to each other — `%!data%` means the
/ action before it, and a model shown one step alone cannot see that. Actions are numbered flat
/ across the goal so the answer needs nothing cross-referenced back.

- render template "/system/builder/llm/templates/propertiesUser.template", write to %propertiesUserMsg%
- render template "/system/builder/llm/Properties.llm", write to %propertiesSystemMsg%
- set %messages% = [{"Role":"system", "Content":"%propertiesSystemMsg%"}, {"Role":"user", "Content":"%propertiesUserMsg%"}]

- llm.query Message=%messages%, Model="gpt-5.4-nano", cache=%!build.cache%, write to %properties%

- call /system/builder/EmitBuildEvent kind="goal-properties", goal=%goal%
